            <title>1.6.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:26:54 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>56</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>View ▸ Refresh</b> (<b>⌥⌘R</b>, or <b>F5</b> like Windows) reads the current folder again. Handy on WebDAV shares, which don't tell the Mac when files change on the server.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Sorting by <b>Size</b> with "Always show folders first" turned off now orders folders and files together by size, so a 9 GB folder no longer sits below a 16 KB file. Folders whose size hasn't been measured yet go to the small end.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
